<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_843_2333.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser früntlichen gruoß, unnd was wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eren</unclear> liebs
<lb n="2"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guotz</unclear> vermoegen, bevor, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürnämn</unclear> unnd wysen
<lb n="3"/>lieb, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> fründ, es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sinnd</unclear> uff datto vor unns erschinen
<lb n="4"/>unnsere <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieben burgere, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürnämen</unclear> unnd
<lb n="5"/>wysen, <persName resp="#ner">Hanns Peyer</persName>, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Connrath</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Krunger</unclear></persName>, <persName resp="#ner">Marx <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wuostler</unclear></persName>,
<lb n="6"/><persName resp="#ner">Hanns Heinrich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Loch</unclear></persName>, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Connrath</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Baltzhoffer</unclear></persName>, <persName resp="#ner">Jacob Voegeli</persName>, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hans</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kapff</unclear></persName>, <persName resp="#ner">Niclaus <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Faltz</unclear></persName>, unnd unns durch iren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürsprechenn</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eröffnen</unclear> lassen, wie unnd ir innen von wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nüw</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ufferlegten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zoltz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halber</unclear> denselbigen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuobezalen</unclear>, zuogeschriben.
<lb n="10"/>Uß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevelch</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehaiß</unclear> der loblichen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">reigierung</unclear> der
<lb n="11"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-559" cert="medium" resp="#ner">ober oesterichischen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lannden</unclear></orgName>, oder aber ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verursacht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ire</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetter</unclear>, unnd waren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nider</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuolegen</unclear>, etc. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermög</unclear> üwer
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlesnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">missive</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underthenniger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear>, wir wellen
<lb n="14"/>inen mit fürgschrifft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beholffn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear>, damit unnd ir sy
<lb n="15"/>wie vormaalen, mit dem zoll halten, unnd still stannden,
<lb n="16"/>so lanng biß, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">züschennd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rö</unclear>. kay. mt. unnser
<lb n="17"/>allergnedigisten herren unnd gemainer loblichen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Aidt</unclear>-
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnoschafft</unclear></orgName> gedachtz <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zolls</unclear> halber ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lütherung</unclear> und ent-
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schaidigung</unclear> bescheche etc. Alßdann wellen sy schuldig
<lb n="20"/>zoll bezallen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Diewyl</unclear> unnd dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zefürdren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pflüchtig</unclear>, unnd schuldig, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelaungt</unclear> an üch
<lb n="22"/>unnser früntlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pitten</unclear>, unnd begeren ir wellen den unnseren
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obbenamten</unclear> burgern den nüwen ufferlegten zoll <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffschryben</unclear>,
<lb n="24"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anston</unclear> lassen biß uff gemainen <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Aidtgnossen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tag</unclear></date>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alßdann</unclear> sinnd wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßr</unclear> hoffnung, werden hochgedachter
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rö</unclear>. kay. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mt</unclear>. commissarij, mit gemainer unnser <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Aidtgnoschafft</unclear></orgName>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zolls</unclear> halber sich verglychen, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">conncordieren</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wo</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>unnd dann sölte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bschlosen</unclear> werden, daß wir <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Aidtgnossen</orgName>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_843_2334.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/>den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gestaigten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffgelegten</unclear> zoll bezallen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alßdann</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear> wir die unsern dahin halten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear> sy <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anndere</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zoell</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abferttigen</unclear>. unnd bezalen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begoeren</unclear> wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">früntlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umb</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> zuverdiennen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">datum</unclear> den <origDate when="1557-12-01" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">1</unclear> decembris. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">a°</unclear> lvij</origDate>
<lb n="33"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-28" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermaister unnd Rath
<lb n="34"/>der Statt Schaffhusen</orgName>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_843_2335.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_843_2336.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="35"/>Den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürnamen</unclear> unnd wysen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Geroegkhrysten</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>zoller, unnd <persName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Erhart <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mur</unclear></persName> gegenschryber, zuo
<lb n="37"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gephartzhoffen</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsern</unclear> lieben, unnd
<lb n="38"/>guoten fründen.
</p>
